# CardWise Implementation Plan

**Source:** [PRD.md](../PRD.md) v1.0  
**Audience:** Engineering and product  
**Scope:** MVP (Phase 1)  
**Status:** Implementation definition, ready to build against

This document turns the PRD into a build plan: stack, services, data model, ingestion, chunking, RAG retrieval, calculation rules, APIs, and delivery slices. Product behaviour, user-facing language, and operating rules live in [DOCUMENTATION.md](./DOCUMENTATION.md).

---

## 1. Decisions locked for MVP

The PRD lists acceptable technologies. These choices are the ones the first build uses.

| Area | Choice | Why |
|---|---|---|
| Mobile | React Native with Expo | One codebase for Android and iOS, fast iteration for an India-first MVP |
| API | Python 3.12 + FastAPI | Matches the ingestion and calculation services, typed request models |
| Primary database | PostgreSQL 16 | Structured reward rules, users, chunk text, and audit history |
| Vector store | ChromaDB | Embeddings and similarity search live here, separate from the rules database |
| Embeddings | Hugging Face `BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5` via `sentence-transformers` | 768-dimension retrieval model, run locally from the Hugging Face Hub |
| LLM | Groq | Extraction into the rule schema, and explanation text. Key: `GROQ_API_KEY` |
| Object storage | S3-compatible bucket | Raw HTML snapshots and PDF originals |
| Auth | Email and password, mobile OTP, and Gmail | Gmail is the fast path. Email and mobile remain available |
| Jobs | A worker process on a queue (Redis + a Python worker) | Scheduled crawls, extraction, and reprocessing stay off the request path |
| Environments | `local`, `staging`, `production` | Staging holds the verified card catalogue used for accuracy tests |

Reward ranking is never produced by asking the model which card is best. Groq writes explanations from numbers the calculation engine already computed, and it assists extraction into a fixed schema. Hugging Face only turns text into vectors. The engine owns the numbers.

