## 11. MVP catalogue

Seed issuers from the PRD: HDFC Bank, Axis Bank, ICICI Bank, SBI Card, American Express, Standard Chartered, IDFC FIRST Bank, IndusInd Bank.

Launch set is 12 card products, two or three from the largest issuers, chosen because their public reward pages are stable enough to verify by hand. Exact product list is a data change in `issuers` and `card_products`, not a code change. A card ships only after one full extraction-and-review cycle. The app browse list is whatever is `live`, so the catalogue can grow without a release.

Categories in MVP: `shopping`, `dining`, `travel`, `grocery`, `fuel`, `utilities`, `other`.

